    {
      "Seq": 11,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Hot steppe",
      "Area": "Clearing",
      "LocationId": 7471,
      "Actor": "Haralhd",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I see the wolf, a rangy creature with fangs bared, a growl in its chest. This one means me harm, right here in this hot steppe. I must stay wary and ready, my legs still from running from the looters.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 12,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Hot steppe",
      "Area": "Clearing",
      "LocationId": 7471,
      "Actor": "Haralhd",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I see the wolf\u0027s rangy form, its fangs swell in the harsh sun, and a growl echoes, rich and deep. I want to draw close, to study this creature closely. I will stay alive here in this scorching steppe, relying on the practical skill of those who have walked these lands before.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 13,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Hot steppe",
      "Area": "Clearing",
      "LocationId": 7471,
      "Actor": "Haralhd",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I thirst, so I drink wolf\u0027s blood. Failed, but the steppe burns.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 14,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Hot steppe",
      "Area": "Clearing",
      "LocationId": 7471,
      "Actor": "Haralhd",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I will not examine the wolf closely, for the hour is not yet ripe, and I sense the price of waiting has come. I could still examine the wolf closely, another way now, by the cutting of carcasses into joints, as the scent of the meat draws me towards its best point before it turns, and I know the price of waiting has not yet come.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 15,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Hot steppe",
      "Area": "Clearing",
      "LocationId": 7471,
      "Actor": "Haralhd",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I cannot come close, for fear the wolf\u0027s sharp teeth might rend my flesh. The threat is real, and the threat is now.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
